WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Four-stroke cycle. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Trace piston, crank and valve events

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A four-stroke spark-ignition teaching model orders intake, compression, power and exhaust across two crankshaft turns. Real valve events overlap.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: One ideal cycle = 2 × 360° = 720° of crank rotation.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Sequence the 720° cycle

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Ideal mechanism only; friction, heat and part-specific behavior need measurements.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Trace piston, crank and valve events
